OL,3,GNEWSAMagistrate given formal warning
OL,4,Aover online posts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Berkshire magistrate who posted
OL,7,Fmessages on social media that could
OL,8,Fhave been "perceived as expressing
OL,9,Fnegative views towards women" has been
OL,10,Fgiven a formal warning.
OL,12,FAham Igbokwe was also found to have
OL,13,Fposted about Nigerian politics in a way
OL,14,Fthat "could reasonably be perceived as
OL,15,Fdemonstrating bias towards a cause".
OL,17,FMagistrates must "exercise caution"
OL,18,Fonline and "should not publish, endorse
OL,19,For share material that could call their
OL,20,Findependence, integrity or impartiality
OL,21,Finto question."
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
